Package: RpubsEncrypt
Title: Encrypt Self-Contained HTML Files
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Andrei", "Pyko", email = "dr.pyko@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5170-9728"))
Description: 
    `RpubsEncrypt` allows users to create self-contained HTML documents and encrypt them using a password.
    It ensures that sensitive HTML reports remain private and secure.
